Strata copy of vllm-xpu-kernels' csrc/xpu/attn/fmha_utils.hpp for the strata-q36 build (libq36_tla.so).

This patch MODIFIES a file of vllm-xpu-kernels (Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-xpu-kernels),
commit ddf336d86e3c8602888572a3502f951abd51df12.  The change: the torch glue is taken out (the paged_kv_utils.h and
torch/all.h includes and the aten_* dtype converters), because the library is built without torch.  Everything else in
the file is as released.  sycl/tools/get-q36-tla.sh applies it after the fetch.  See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
